http://www.nemorathwald.com/lojban_logo.jpg

Nice logo. I like the left most best.

Possibly reducing the complexity. Using 3 or just 2 circles, and 
perhaps one circle larger than the other, introducing asymmetry can 
make it more distinctive.

I didn't like the flag as much, but it sure is professional. I'm not 
sure what the flag's decoration means. I'm kind of against the flag 
idea, because i view lojban as a scientific pursuit, not another 
cultural and national and political sentimentality.

